    fix(core): include entryPoint and stable constants in PipelineFactory compute pipeline hash
    
    Two compute specs differing only in entryPoint or override constants previously
    received the same cached pipeline. Render hash audited: WebGPU render hash already
    includes vertex/fragment entry points; vs/fsConstants are unused by pipeline creation.
    
    (cherry picked from commit c80b7ce6d0a3c05d7f4541ceff15228139a9b216)

diff --git a/modules/core/src/factories/pipeline-factory.ts b/modules/core/src/factories/pipeline-factory.ts
